### 성과유형 (시행령 별표4 등록 성과 중 공개 API 제공분: 논문·특허)
ex:CS_OUTPUTTYPE a skos:ConceptScheme ;
    rdfs:label "연구개발성과 유형"@ko .
ex:OT_PAPER a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme ex:CS_OUTPUTTYPE ;
    skos:prefLabel "논문"@ko ;
    rdfs:label "논문"@ko .
ex:OT_PAPER_JNL_INTL a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme ex:CS_OUTPUTTYPE ;
    skos:prefLabel "국외전문학술지 논문"@ko ;
    rdfs:label "국외전문학술지 논문"@ko ;
    skos:broader ex:OT_PAPER .
ex:OT_PAPER_JNL_DOM a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme ex:CS_OUTPUTTYPE ;
    skos:prefLabel "국내전문학술지 논문"@ko ;
    rdfs:label "국내전문학술지 논문"@ko ;
    skos:broader ex:OT_PAPER .
ex:OT_PAPER_CONF_INTL a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme ex:CS_OUTPUTTYPE ;
    skos:prefLabel "국외학술대회 발표논문"@ko ;
    rdfs:label "국외학술대회 발표논문"@ko ;
    skos:broader ex:OT_PAPER .
ex:OT_PAPER_CONF_DOM a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme ex:CS_OUTPUTTYPE ;
    skos:prefLabel "국내학술대회 발표논문"@ko ;
    rdfs:label "국내학술대회 발표논문"@ko ;
    skos:broader ex:OT_PAPER .
ex:OT_PAPER_OTHER a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme ex:CS_OUTPUTTYPE ;
    skos:prefLabel "기타 논문집"@ko ;
    rdfs:label "기타 논문집"@ko ;
    skos:broader ex:OT_PAPER .
ex:OT_PATENT a skos:Concept ;
